OL,3,GNEWSAToy tractors on sale to make room
OL,4,Afor more items
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large collection of about 500 toy
OL,7,FJohn Deere tractors are being put up
OL,8,Ffor sale at auction so their owner can
OL,9,Fbuy more collectables.
OL,11,FPeter Green, 77, from Saffron Walden,
OL,12,FEssex, has amassed the items over 12
OL,13,Fyears, but has decided to only put
OL,14,Fabout half of what he owns up for sale.
OL,16,FHe said: "The house is just about full
OL,17,Fup and I need to be able to make space
OL,18,Ffor the other part of my collection."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
