OL,3,GNEWSAToy tractors on sale to make room
OL,4,Afor more items
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is expected the bespoke commission,
OL,7,Fa 8650 Kinze conversion; a 4520 V8 with
OL,8,Ftwin rear wheels and a modern 9RX830,
OL,9,Fcould fetch between #300 to #500
OL,10,Fapiece, at the Cheffins vintage sale on
OL,11,F16 October in Cambridge.
